          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "**Finding:** Work order **MO-25-09-1070** (`WO-2025-09-004`) has a component-issue **INPUT** event, source transaction **`TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070`**, for **28,476,342 cents ($284,763.42)**.\n\n- **Event created:** `2025-09-30T19:15:00`\n- **September period entered Pending Close:** `2025-09-30T18:00:00`\n- **Time late:** **75 minutes**\n- **Recorded accounting status:** **POSTED**\n\n**Conclusion:** The recorded status is **not consistent** with Oracle’s documented Pending Close treatment. Oracle’s supplied policy says new transactions created after Pending Close are not processed, with exceptions for revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments. This component-issue INPUT event is not one of those exceptions.\n\nThe review was read-only; no database records were changed. The report was submitted and verified.",
